# Lesson 100: a Russian story
subtitle: "Lesson 100: read Masha's winter trip to Petersburg with Tom, sixteen lines with only two glosses: a lost passport, a broken shower, the metro, minus fifteen, and a postcard home. Hear it line by line, test yourself by eye and by ear, say a saying, and see what a hundred lessons have given you."
tags: ["russian","russian reading","russian story","russian travel","petersburg"]
teaches: ["reading/reading-stories"]
thumb: "band \"Lesson 100: a Russian story\" note \"Petersburg in winter, 16\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Why and because in Russian: потому что","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/101-russian-because.cast"}

## Lesson 100: a Russian story
level: basic
heading: false

    box card "" #8f887c x 500 y 262 width 980 height 330 radius 18 hidden true
    glossed s1 "В январе́ мы с То́мом полете́ли в Петербу́рг." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 640 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s2 "В аэропорту́ Том вдруг сказа́л: «Где мой па́спорт?»" say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 490 width 990 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s3 "Он был в чемода́не, а поса́дка — че́рез пять мину́т!" say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 340 width 990 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s4 "Мы пришли́ по́здно, но лу́чше по́здно, чем никогда́!" say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 190 width 990 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s5 "В Петербу́рге я заброни́ровала но́мер на двои́х." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 640 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s6 "Но в но́мере не рабо́тал душ!" say_voice b gloss ["","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 490 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s7 "«Ничего́, — сказа́л Том, — за́втрак включён!»" say_voice b gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 340 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s8 "Я сказа́ла: «У́тро ве́чера мудрене́е»." say_voice b gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 190 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s9 "И пра́вда: у́тром душ уже́ рабо́тал." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 640 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s10 "Пото́м мы пое́хали на метро́ в Эрмита́ж." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","","the Hermitage"] show_gloss after x 500 y 490 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s11 "«Ско́лько е́хать?» — «Три ста́нции и переса́дка»." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 340 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s12 "Был моро́з: ми́нус пятна́дцать гра́дусов!" say_voice b gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 190 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s13 "Днём бы́ло со́лнце, а в Эрмита́же бы́ло тепло́." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 640 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s14 "А ве́чером я написа́ла ма́ме откры́тку:" say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","a postcard"] show_gloss after x 500 y 490 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s15 "«Дорога́я ма́ма! Тут хо́лодно, но нам ве́село." say_voice b gloss ["","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 340 width 990 font_size 36 hidden true
    glossed s16 "Обнима́ю, до встре́чи! Твоя́ Ма́ша»." say_voice b gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 190 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
